1
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:15,550
♪I lean and gaze at misty waves afar♪

2
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,320
♪Tears fall on the ancient road
'neath the setting sun♪

3
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,460
♪One lone shadow on the cold river♪

4
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,910
♪In dreams, I return to the old window♪

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,670
♪Mountains stretch, the road home fades♪

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,030
♪A flute cries out, hooves hurry on♪

7
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,790
♪My heart adrift beneath a frosted moon♪

8
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,220
♪Drinking alone, I mourn our parting♪

9
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Night turns cold, wind stirs the veil♪

10
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,760
♪Old robes recall forgotten days♪

11
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,570
♪Heart sore, a lone goose flies south♪

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,230
♪Where shall I send this letter?♪

13
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,760
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

14
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Love runs deep, dreams linger on♪

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,390
♪Only sorrow remains♪

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,340
♪A cup of wine, my shadow makes us two♪

17
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,980
♪Drunk and lost through flashing blades♪

18
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,870
♪I curse how swiftly the years pass by♪

19
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,580
♪The wandering road goes on♪

20
00:00:58,590 --> 00:01:01,020
♪Desolate, time frosts my youthful hair♪

21
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,340
♪Through the years, love still burns♪

22
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,530
♪A thousand tears fall♪

23
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,030
♪Worlds apart, tears stain my sleeves♪

24
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:11,300
♪Old dreams haunt my heart,
tears cloud my eyes♪

25
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,340
♪Heartbroken, soul-worn,
pain won't fade♪

26
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,820
♪Moonlight westward, the night drags on♪

27
00:01:14,830 --> 00:01:17,920
♪The years have left their scars♪

28
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,280
♪Autumn winds sweep leaves;
shadows pair♪

29
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,590
♪The past fades like smoke;
tears fall♪

30
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:26,820
♪My heart lies broken♪

31
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:30,150
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

32
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:34,980
[Love Legend]

33
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,780
[Episode 17]

34
00:02:14,470 --> 00:02:14,930
Sir.

35
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:22,420
Sir.

36
00:02:26,200 --> 00:02:27,920
Yun Shao, what brings you here?

37
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:29,600
I'm here for Lord Pei.

38
00:02:30,890 --> 00:02:32,530
He defied his superior.

39
00:02:33,180 --> 00:02:34,510
I punished him by law.

40
00:02:34,710 --> 00:02:35,700
Are you done, Your Highness?

41
00:02:36,200 --> 00:02:37,090
Can we go now?

42
00:02:39,110 --> 00:02:39,750
Yes.

43
00:02:40,190 --> 00:02:41,630
Lord Pei has been punished.

44
00:02:41,840 --> 00:02:43,250
I'm sure he won't do it again.

45
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:52,900
Han Jin.

46
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:55,520
Did you see Pei Zhao's right shoulder?

47
00:02:56,240 --> 00:02:57,510
Was there a scar?

48
00:02:59,020 --> 00:02:59,810
Was there?

49
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:00,990
Yes.

50
00:03:02,210 --> 00:03:03,800
Was it shaped like a hibiscus?

51
00:03:19,170 --> 00:03:20,830
Fengyi Guards get injured all the time.

52
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:21,780
It's just a scar.

53
00:03:21,780 --> 00:03:22,980
Don't make such a fuss.

54
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:30,320
Don't go.

55
00:03:31,700 --> 00:03:32,590
Softhearted fool.

56
00:03:35,460 --> 00:03:36,410
Stop Pei Zhao.

57
00:03:36,690 --> 00:03:37,680
Stop him.

58
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:38,910
Mother Consort, what are you doing?

59
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:41,630
Why are you stopping me?

60
00:03:41,630 --> 00:03:43,080
I told you to stop Pei Zhao.

61
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:48,360
His punishment is over.

62
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:49,300
He can leave.

63
00:03:49,710 --> 00:03:51,730
Mother Consort, take care and go back.

64
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:57,240
Why did you punish Pei Zhao so harshly?

65
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:03,240
You're talking nonsense.

66
00:04:06,110 --> 00:04:06,580
Fool.

67
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:27,510
Sir, have some water.

68
00:04:31,380 --> 00:04:32,740
His Majesty has sealed the Fengyi Bureau

69
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:33,810
and ordered your arrest.

70
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:37,350
Something must've happened to him.

71
00:04:39,010 --> 00:04:39,540
No.

72
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:41,220
I must seek an audience.

73
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:43,360
No. You need to recover.

74
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,190
Let me go.

75
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:44,840
No.

76
00:04:45,190 --> 00:04:46,270
I'm a Fengyi Guard too.

77
00:04:48,280 --> 00:04:49,260
Fengyi Guards, listen.

78
00:04:56,100 --> 00:04:56,820
I order you

79
00:04:58,100 --> 00:04:58,980
to leave the city at once.

80
00:05:06,770 --> 00:05:07,170
Sir.

81
00:05:10,340 --> 00:05:11,200
From now on,

82
00:05:11,810 --> 00:05:12,370
I make the decisions.

83
00:05:18,660 --> 00:05:19,360
You shouldn't

84
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:21,720
have come that day.

85
00:05:23,310 --> 00:05:24,420
[Eighteen Years Ago]
Breathe.

86
00:05:24,430 --> 00:05:25,720
Push. Push.

87
00:05:26,060 --> 00:05:26,950
Breathe.

88
00:05:27,260 --> 00:05:27,900
Almost there.

89
00:05:28,090 --> 00:05:28,720
I can see the head.

90
00:05:28,850 --> 00:05:29,670
Push.

91
00:05:35,820 --> 00:05:36,610
A chubby baby boy.

92
00:05:36,910 --> 00:05:38,030
Congratulations.

93
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:03,870
This ruler stained with Pei Zhao's blood

94
00:06:04,070 --> 00:06:05,830
looks even brighter.

95
00:06:11,430 --> 00:06:12,580
Brighter?

96
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:16,270
That's your son's blood.

97
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,530
I gave him

98
00:06:29,840 --> 00:06:31,630
that scar

99
00:06:32,320 --> 00:06:33,920
with this Light-Feather Hairpin.

100
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,390
I'd know it anywhere.

101
00:06:37,370 --> 00:06:38,270
For over twenty years,

102
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:41,810
I've thought of that child every day.

103
00:06:42,470 --> 00:06:43,780
He was so tiny.

104
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:45,460
So soft.

105
00:06:47,010 --> 00:06:48,950
Nestled in my arms.

106
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:51,310
His bright eyes

107
00:06:53,340 --> 00:06:55,270
just looking at me.

108
00:06:59,850 --> 00:07:00,710
Perhaps

109
00:07:01,830 --> 00:07:03,000
it was just an arrow wound.

110
00:07:03,430 --> 00:07:04,770
No. It's not.

111
00:07:08,290 --> 00:07:09,520
You made this Light-Feather Hairpin

112
00:07:10,180 --> 00:07:12,070
by your own hands

113
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:14,050
as a token of love.

114
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:17,460
When I heard he'd died,

115
00:07:18,450 --> 00:07:20,960
I had the blood jade made into a pendant

116
00:07:21,720 --> 00:07:23,790
and placed around his neck

117
00:07:24,430 --> 00:07:25,890
to be buried with him.

118
00:07:28,090 --> 00:07:29,630
I only hoped

119
00:07:31,050 --> 00:07:32,870
he'd be my son again.

120
00:07:40,910 --> 00:07:42,490
Even if he is that child,

121
00:07:43,270 --> 00:07:44,740
we can't just claim him.

122
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:50,870
Why not?

123
00:07:52,530 --> 00:07:53,480
I'm ordering you.

124
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:55,740
Bring him back.

125
00:07:57,140 --> 00:07:58,450
We owe him.

126
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:00,680
We have to make it right.

127
00:08:02,110 --> 00:08:02,510
All right.

128
00:08:04,100 --> 00:08:04,440
All right.

129
00:08:05,380 --> 00:08:06,060
I promise.

130
00:08:06,470 --> 00:08:07,550
I'll bring him back.

131
00:08:15,390 --> 00:08:15,920
Your Highness.

132
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:17,360
Your Highness.

133
00:08:17,870 --> 00:08:19,270
The Fengyi Bureau is sealed,

134
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:21,240
but Pei Zhao escaped.

135
00:08:24,950 --> 00:08:25,680
Send word.

136
00:08:26,390 --> 00:08:27,390
Once he is found,

137
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:28,300
end him.

138
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:29,680
Your Highness.

139
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:31,360
What about the Noble Consort?

140
00:08:31,600 --> 00:08:32,310
What do we tell her?

141
00:08:32,750 --> 00:08:35,000
She's always valued Pei Zhao.

142
00:08:38,510 --> 00:08:39,720
The rebels kill him.

143
00:08:40,030 --> 00:08:41,200
What's that got to do with me?

144
00:08:42,390 --> 00:08:43,840
Those not of one mind with me

145
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:45,150
need not be spared.

146
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:46,030
Your Highness.

147
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:47,910
Pei Zhao is easy to remove,

148
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:51,510
but it may drive a wedge

149
00:08:51,650 --> 00:08:52,880
between you and the Noble Consort.

150
00:09:00,110 --> 00:09:00,520
Come here.

151
00:09:02,750 --> 00:09:03,910
I'll tell you a secret.

152
00:09:05,170 --> 00:09:07,480
I'm not worthy, Your Highness.

153
00:09:08,030 --> 00:09:09,240
Doesn't matter.

154
00:09:09,630 --> 00:09:10,320
You're one of us.

155
00:09:15,390 --> 00:09:16,870
Pei Zhao

156
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:21,320
is my son with the Noble Consort.

157
00:09:29,630 --> 00:09:32,030
Anyone who defies me,

158
00:09:32,680 --> 00:09:33,720
whoever they are,

159
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:35,670
must die.

160
00:09:36,790 --> 00:09:37,910
I swear loyalty unto death.

161
00:09:39,550 --> 00:09:40,750
This realm

162
00:09:41,630 --> 00:09:43,000
belongs to the capable.

163
00:09:57,030 --> 00:09:58,030
You wicked woman.

164
00:09:58,270 --> 00:09:59,630
You killed my mother.

165
00:10:03,030 --> 00:10:04,030
Drop the sword.

166
00:10:12,790 --> 00:10:14,030
Have you lost your mind?

167
00:10:14,390 --> 00:10:15,440
You'd kill your mother?

168
00:10:20,360 --> 00:10:21,270
Everyone out.

169
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:30,240
I'm your real mother.

170
00:10:48,790 --> 00:10:50,270
You were born in the Cold Palace.

171
00:10:50,870 --> 00:10:51,670
Pei Zhao

172
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:53,910
was born before I entered the palace.

173
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:56,440
You two are brothers.

174
00:10:57,390 --> 00:10:58,720
Your real father

175
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:00,440
is Han Jin.

176
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:01,600
You're lying.

177
00:11:03,320 --> 00:11:05,200
For 18 years, you've ruled the harem.

178
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:08,150
Forbidding a single child
from being born.

179
00:11:09,270 --> 00:11:10,600
You're ruthless.

180
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:11,510
Monstrous.

181
00:11:11,510 --> 00:11:14,030
And now you make up such a wild excuse?

182
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:15,080
I'm not lying.

183
00:11:17,270 --> 00:11:18,870
Haven't you ever wondered

184
00:11:19,550 --> 00:11:21,630
why your Blood Jade Ritual failed?

185
00:11:27,270 --> 00:11:28,870
True royal blood

186
00:11:32,270 --> 00:11:34,270
makes blood jade glow

187
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:36,320
with a single drop.

188
00:11:39,390 --> 00:11:40,600
Look at yours.

189
00:11:49,870 --> 00:11:50,840
Did it react?

190
00:11:51,200 --> 00:11:52,080
No.

191
00:11:52,910 --> 00:11:54,150
How can this be?

192
00:11:56,030 --> 00:11:59,000
My mother was Empress of Yong.

193
00:12:03,270 --> 00:12:05,670
I can't be your child with Han Jin.

194
00:12:09,440 --> 00:12:10,360
It's you.

195
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:13,200
You have feelings for Pei Zhao.

196
00:12:13,200 --> 00:12:14,320
You did this.

197
00:12:14,510 --> 00:12:15,870
You're protecting him.

198
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:16,840
You fool!

199
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:19,910
How dare you slander me?

200
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:22,720
If your brother were here,

201
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:24,320
he'd never do this.

202
00:12:29,790 --> 00:12:30,480
Qingyan.

203
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:32,120
I hit you too hard.

204
00:12:32,120 --> 00:12:32,840
I'm sorry.

205
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:33,480
Don't touch me.

206
00:12:36,080 --> 00:12:37,390
Brother?

207
00:12:38,870 --> 00:12:40,270
I was never as good as him.

208
00:12:41,910 --> 00:12:43,120
For 18 years,

209
00:12:43,910 --> 00:12:46,200
you've picked at everything I do.

210
00:12:47,550 --> 00:12:50,000
Nothing I do is ever good enough.

211
00:12:52,150 --> 00:12:53,750
If you hate me so much,

212
00:12:54,630 --> 00:12:56,600
why have an affair?

213
00:12:56,750 --> 00:12:58,390
Why give birth to me?

214
00:13:02,520 --> 00:13:03,140
Qingyan.

215
00:13:23,270 --> 00:13:24,670
If you already had him,

216
00:13:25,150 --> 00:13:26,270
why have me?

217
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:28,000
Pei Zhao.

218
00:13:28,630 --> 00:13:31,030
You won't take anything of mine.

219
00:13:40,460 --> 00:13:43,020
[Shanhua Valley]

220
00:13:43,030 --> 00:13:43,440
Sir.

221
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:45,120
This is Shanhua Valley.

222
00:13:47,270 --> 00:13:48,630
Rebel families live here,

223
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:50,030
along with Blood Jade Mine workers.

224
00:13:53,630 --> 00:13:54,440
Ruoli.

225
00:13:54,550 --> 00:13:55,630
Have one.

226
00:13:55,840 --> 00:13:56,390
Okay.

227
00:13:56,550 --> 00:13:57,390
You should have some too.

228
00:13:59,440 --> 00:14:00,080
Shandou.

229
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:01,200
Can I have one too?

230
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:05,000
Haven't had one in ages.

231
00:14:05,080 --> 00:14:06,000
Chang'an, what's this?

232
00:14:06,080 --> 00:14:06,440
Is it good?

233
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:06,910
Yeah.

234
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:08,030
You pampered brat.

235
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:09,600
Never had wild fruit?

236
00:14:15,670 --> 00:14:16,720
Madam Yun, try one.

237
00:14:17,680 --> 00:14:18,150
Thanks.

238
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:19,970
It's a myrtle berry.

239
00:14:22,240 --> 00:14:23,550
You know wild fruit?

240
00:14:24,080 --> 00:14:25,150
I ate them a lot as a child.

241
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:27,870
I worked the mine for 14 years

242
00:14:28,440 --> 00:14:29,910
and joined the Fengyi Bureau at 14.

243
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:31,790
Just to be their dog.

244
00:14:32,030 --> 00:14:33,150
Yet you sound proud.

245
00:14:34,840 --> 00:14:35,270
Ruoli.

246
00:14:35,910 --> 00:14:36,600
Enough.

247
00:14:38,390 --> 00:14:39,000
Don't mind her, sir.

248
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:41,870
She's always like this.

249
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:42,910
Sharp tongue, soft heart.

250
00:14:43,670 --> 00:14:44,270
No offense taken.

251
00:14:45,630 --> 00:14:47,000
Thank you for taking us in.

252
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:48,030
I am deeply grateful.

253
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:49,440
Thank you for your kindness.

254
00:14:54,440 --> 00:14:55,510
You spared my life once.

255
00:14:55,760 --> 00:14:56,440
I saved yours in return.

256
00:14:56,910 --> 00:14:57,670
So now we're even.

257
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:00,440
Sir.

258
00:15:01,080 --> 00:15:01,870
There's a hot spring out back.

259
00:15:02,030 --> 00:15:02,790
It'll help your wounds.

260
00:15:03,200 --> 00:15:04,030
I'll take you there.

261
00:15:04,480 --> 00:15:05,000
Really?

262
00:15:05,720 --> 00:15:06,960
I've never tried a hot spring.

263
00:15:19,790 --> 00:15:21,600
This place is great.

264
00:15:21,600 --> 00:15:24,200
♪Moonlight sways, flowers scent the air♪

265
00:15:25,030 --> 00:15:26,200
Too bad the world outside

266
00:15:26,670 --> 00:15:27,670
is far from peaceful.

267
00:15:31,240 --> 00:15:32,360
I hope

268
00:15:32,630 --> 00:15:34,670
the world finds peace,

269
00:15:35,150 --> 00:15:36,120
with no more war.

270
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:39,120
Everyone fed and warm.

271
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:40,910
Every family with a home.

272
00:15:41,120 --> 00:15:42,450
Every child in school.

273
00:15:42,450 --> 00:15:47,110
♪Your blade stands shielding by my side♪

274
00:15:47,200 --> 00:15:47,960
You can achieve it.

275
00:15:50,630 --> 00:15:51,910
We can achieve it.

276
00:15:51,910 --> 00:15:58,600
♪The crescent moon binds me
to memories past♪

277
00:15:58,900 --> 00:16:05,450
♪Endless bonds,
a mountain we cannot pass♪

278
00:16:05,780 --> 00:16:12,310
♪Meetings and partings
ripple in your eyes♪

279
00:16:12,670 --> 00:16:19,490
♪We shared the storm,
yet cannot cut the ties♪

280
00:16:26,720 --> 00:16:27,670
Actually,

281
00:16:28,390 --> 00:16:29,200
there's something

282
00:16:30,390 --> 00:16:31,440
I'm not sure

283
00:16:31,720 --> 00:16:32,720
I should tell you yet.

284
00:16:34,510 --> 00:16:35,750
If you're not sure,

285
00:16:36,550 --> 00:16:37,270
don't.

286
00:16:40,040 --> 00:16:46,450
♪Your burning gaze strips my guard away♪

287
00:16:46,820 --> 00:16:50,080
♪Fengyi blades lie hidden in the dark♪

288
00:16:50,410 --> 00:16:53,650
♪For one moment, all is lost to love♪

289
00:16:54,230 --> 00:17:00,730
♪Your blade stands shielding by my side♪

290
00:17:00,750 --> 00:17:01,320
Eww.

291
00:17:01,510 --> 00:17:02,360
So icky.

292
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:04,070
Don't look.

293
00:17:05,110 --> 00:17:06,000
Shandou is watching too.

294
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:09,270
You either.

295
00:17:13,680 --> 00:17:14,550
He's grown up.

296
00:17:15,240 --> 00:17:16,160
Time to settle down.

297
00:17:16,790 --> 00:17:17,960
You're the same age as him.

298
00:17:18,200 --> 00:17:18,960
Stop pretending.

299
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:20,440
Is that so?

300
00:17:22,110 --> 00:17:22,720
The same age?

301
00:17:23,070 --> 00:17:25,350
Chang'an's back is covered in wounds.

302
00:17:25,550 --> 00:17:27,310
He cried from the pain.

303
00:17:28,270 --> 00:17:29,880
Lord Pei is wounded too.

304
00:17:29,960 --> 00:17:31,070
Doesn't he hurt?

305
00:17:32,400 --> 00:17:33,350
Oh, you.

306
00:17:34,160 --> 00:17:34,880
Well...

307
00:17:34,960 --> 00:17:36,270
One pretty face,

308
00:17:36,590 --> 00:17:37,510
and he forget the pain.

309
00:17:38,240 --> 00:17:40,160
Wounds from the blood-jade ruler

310
00:17:40,160 --> 00:17:41,350
don't heal easily.

311
00:17:42,480 --> 00:17:44,200
Herbs can heal Chang'an and me.

312
00:17:44,920 --> 00:17:46,310
But blood-jade wounds

313
00:17:46,310 --> 00:17:47,240
need medicine from Guard Infirmary.

314
00:17:48,350 --> 00:17:50,160
It was sealed recently.

315
00:17:51,240 --> 00:17:52,510
I know somewhere

316
00:17:52,510 --> 00:17:53,310
we can find some.

317
00:17:53,680 --> 00:17:54,400
Where?

318
00:17:55,880 --> 00:17:57,790
To treat Shanhua villagers,

319
00:17:58,160 --> 00:17:59,400
I took some

320
00:18:00,270 --> 00:18:01,000
from Guard Infirmary

321
00:18:01,960 --> 00:18:03,640
and hid it at Anfu Pharmacy in the east.

322
00:18:08,720 --> 00:18:09,480
So we know

323
00:18:09,640 --> 00:18:10,270
where it is.

324
00:18:11,200 --> 00:18:12,030
But who's going to get it?

325
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:15,590
Look at you.

326
00:18:15,590 --> 00:18:17,110
Hurt or crippled.

327
00:18:17,400 --> 00:18:19,270
Guess I have to go.

328
00:18:19,790 --> 00:18:21,400
Otherwise, if anyone dies here,

329
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:22,350
my brother will blame me.

330
00:18:23,160 --> 00:18:24,310
I'll go with you.

331
00:18:24,790 --> 00:18:25,720
All right.

332
00:18:38,960 --> 00:18:41,770
♪A cold blade gleams by the window♪

333
00:18:43,390 --> 00:18:46,580
♪Candle tears harden into frost♪

334
00:18:47,900 --> 00:18:49,640
♪Moon shadows flicker and sway♪

335
00:18:50,140 --> 00:18:54,580
♪A wisp of longing haunts the air♪

336
00:18:56,740 --> 00:18:59,410
♪A lone boat rests on the misty river♪

337
00:19:00,630 --> 00:19:05,640
♪That promise lies sealed with my sword♪

338
00:19:05,960 --> 00:19:13,990
♪I turn to find the world in snow♪

339
00:19:14,260 --> 00:19:22,880
♪Fated destiny ties from bygone life♪

340
00:19:22,880 --> 00:19:31,550
♪Longing for one beloved flows on♪

341
00:19:31,930 --> 00:19:40,800
♪I can't let go of the verses lost
across this vast land♪

342
00:19:41,230 --> 00:19:49,720
♪Yet I let go of that fleeting light
within your eyes♪
